omments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:07:01Z","email":"278954389+qin-ye_ZSinc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Qin Ye"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T03:07:01Z","email":"278954389+qin-ye_ZSinc@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Qin Ye"},"message":"feat(08-safety-foundation): complete Wave 1 - domain contracts, auth roles, DB schema, SQL repository\n\n- Define Safety bounded context: 11 entity types with provenance-first design\n  * SafetyCandidateSignal must reference SafetySourceVersion (immutable)\n  * SafetySignalTransition append-only with actor + rationale\n  * SafetyAuditEvent captures all state changes for compliance\n\n- Extend shared auth: PV roles (pv_admin, pv_reviewer, pv_read_only)\n  * Integrated into existing AppRole enum\n  * Works with existing requireRole() helper\n  * No custom auth bypass logic\n\n- Bootstrap 10 Safety tables with FKs\n  * Enforces immutability constraints\n  * Append-only for transitions and audit\n\n- Implement SQL Safety Repository (350 lines)\n  * 23 operations: create, read, list, update, append\n  * Type-safe mapping between domain and SQL\n  * Raw SQL for compliance auditability\n\n- Tests: 7/7 passing\n  * Contract validation for entity shapes\n  * Transition invariants\n  * Source version immutability\n  * Audit event provenance\n\n- Lint: 0 errors, 0 warnings\n\nPer D-01, D-02, D-10, D-11 (locked decisions from Phase 08 CONTEXT.md)","tree":{"sha":"2a1f596fec5a4f85cb0bcdc1ddd9e8a82baed889","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeqin4814/HelixOS/git/trees/2a1f596fec5a4f85cb0bcdc1ddd9e8a82baed889"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yeqin4814/HelixOS/git/commits/42e63a2231b7a0827996a7ef79de93e5c1ee88bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278954389?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qin-ye_ZSinc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gi