":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/dd665b1ac4a758ffde0b0acbf5c4610f891c576f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:20:01Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:20:01Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"docs: consolidate the docs landing and prune the off-topic tutorial\n\nCuts the newcomer''s biggest friction on the docs site -- being told the\nsame thing five different ways before reaching one clear answer.\n\n- index.md: merged the duplicate \"What It Is For\" + \"What This Software Is\"\n  sections into a single 60-second \"What Director-AI is\" definition, and\n  removed the reader-routing table that duplicated \"First 30 Minutes\".\n- Dropped notebook 05 (SSGF / Kuramoto geometry) from the tutorial table and\n  the notebook gallery: it is SCPN-framework content that does not import\n  director_ai and points readers to a different repository, so it does not\n  belong in the Director-AI tutorial set. The 18 -> 17 notebook counts follow.\n  The .ipynb file is left in place pending an owner call on deleting it.\n- README About: reframed the origin so the research heritage reads as\n  credibility (\"began as an internal research tool ... now an open-core\n  product any team can adopt\") rather than an experimental disclaimer.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b354cae040984a1a4a021e6bb1eba17866f74a29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/b354cae040984a1a4a021e6bb1eba17866f74a29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/dd665b1ac4a758ffde0b0acbf5c4610f891c576f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/dd665b1ac4a758ffde0b0acbf5c4610f891c576f","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGRkNjY1YjFhYzRhNzU4ZmZkZTBiMGFjYmY1YzQ2MTBmODkxYzU3NmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb","sha":"f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb"}],"sha":"dd665b1ac4a758ffde0b0acbf5c4610f891c576f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/dd665b1ac4a758ffde0b0acbf5c4610f891c576f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:01:25Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:02:49Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"docs: resolve cross-page contradictions on pricing, latency, and version\n\nThe docs surface is large and builds clean, but load-bearing buyer facts\ncontradicted each other across pages -- the most trust-damaging failure of\nall. Aligned every page to the authoritative source:\n\n- Pricing: the README product ladder now matches the canonical pricing.md\n  and the live remanentia.com/pricing.html -- Pro USD 199/mo (1,990/yr),\n  Full USD 499/mo (4,990/yr), Class USD 999/mo (9,990/yr). The stale\n  CHF 490/980 numbers are gone.\n- Free-tier boundary: the REST/gRPC server and proxy are Apache-2.0 free\n  core (verified at the module SPDX headers), so they move out of the paid\n  Pro row into the free Director-AI row -- consistent with the README\n  licence section and pricing.md, which both already treat the server as\n  free.\n- GPU NLI latency: normalised the buyer-facing headline to the committed\n  ~14.6 ms/pair ONNX-GPU-batch figure across index/why/pricing; the\n  best-case 0.5 ms L40S (FP16, batch=32) stays labelled as best-case.\n  Removes the apparent 0.5 / 0.9 / 14.6 ms spread a reader would hit.\n- Removed the stale hardcoded tests-8253_passed badge from the docs\n  landing (the CI badge already proves green; the count had drifted).\n- notebooks/04: dropped the stale \"v3.9.4\" version stamp.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"ca252ce8e0743fb2ce3c0f56c61a1201a484dfb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/ca252ce8e0743fb2ce3c0f56c61a1201a484dfb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/f0f5a35489df6cd747c596df6e0621ba3399d8fb","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGYwZjVhMzU0ODlkZjZjZDc0N2M1OTZkZjZlMDYyMWJhMzM5OWQ4ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"h