//api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/cc2ecc837dd2fea85a92d66256f567cb22f8ce34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:59:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:59:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"release: bump to 3.19.0 (minor, additive) + claim-honest docs\n\nVersion 3.18.1 -> 3.19.0 across all carriers (root + lite/full/pro pyproject,\n__init__ x2, CITATION.cff, .zenodo.json, doc version headers, SBOMs, capability\nmanifest) plus the inter-package dependency floors. SemVer MINOR: additive\nsurface only — CoherenceScore.abstained + core.scoring.selective_prediction,\nprobability calibration, the committed FEVER benchmark, and the streaming\ncontradiction-halt corpus n>=500/class with halt_recall_by_kind. No breaking\nchanges.\n\nCHANGELOG [3.19.0] and public docs carry the honest per-mode claims (RELEASE\nGATE P3): contradiction-halt semantic recall 0.9309 / numeric 0.5586 / aggregate\n0.7179 (numeric a documented roadmap gap); RAGTruth whole-response catch 71.8% /\nFPR 55.2% (refreshed from the stale 49.3% L40S number, git 9bd36d4c) kept\ndistinct from the claim-level ~82% KB-grounded balanced accuracy; FEVER 78.4%\n(3-class, provenance).\n\nReversible release candidate on main — the irreversible tag v3.19.0 -> PyPI is\nheld for the owner''s direct publish-go. Temp-branch prep is blocked by the fleet\nbranch guard, so the candidate lands on main with the tag held, which preserves\nthe no-irreversible-action requirement.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"4c45f13e624c7960c9e09ba760255a3ed10db2f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/4c45f13e624c7960c9e09ba760255a3ed10db2f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/cc2ecc837dd2fea85a92d66256f567cb22f8ce34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"