:"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/a92103dc6c9f841bfbdc9a17b3d321fd3e75f7bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:30:46Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:30:46Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"bench(streaming): isolated contradiction-halt refresh at n>=500/class (WCE-2)\n\nRefresh streaming_contradiction_halt_base on the enlarged corpus (612 good /\n507 bad) on an isolated JarvisLabs A30 GPU (load average 2.2 vs the earlier\nnon-isolated 33). The isolated re-run resolves the load-contamination the old\nartefact carried; host isolation is now classified from the live load average\n(isolated_quiet) instead of a hard-coded label.\n\nThe headline capability holds: semantic contradictions are caught at 0.9309\nrecall (202/217), consistent with the prior 0.9333, at a 0.0065 false-halt rate\n(4/612). The enlarged corpus surfaces a real gap — numeric-value contradictions\nare caught at only 0.5586 recall (162/290), where NLI-based detection reasons\nweakly over bare numbers — pulling the aggregate to 0.7179 (364/507). The\nbenchmark now records this split in halt_recall_by_kind (a contradiction is\nnumeric when its corrupted fragment is a bare number). Docs and the claim-docs\npin are updated to the refreshed numbers.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"dae1db8dc151e631c9fa5b178f4d2fa6efab1f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/dae1db8dc151e631c9fa5b178f4d2fa6efab1f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/a92103dc6c9f841bfbdc9a17b3d321fd3e75f7bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/a92103dc6c9f841bfbdc9a17b3d321fd3e75f7bc","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGE5MjEwM2RjNmM5Zjg0MWJmYmRjOWExN2IzZDMyMWZkM2U3NWY3YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c","sha":"83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c"}],"sha":"a92103dc6c9f841bfbdc9a17b3d321fd3e75f7bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/a92103dc6c9f841bfbdc9a17b3d321fd3e75f7bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:02:01Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T17:02:01Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"bench(streaming): expand halt corpus to >=500/class (WCE-2)\n\nThe streaming halt corpus (shared by the false-halt and contradiction-halt\nbenchmarks) held only 135 good / 30 bad passages, and the committed\nstreaming_contradiction_halt_base run was measured under load_average 33-36\n(isolation: non_isolated_local_regression). Lift the corpus to 612 good / 507\nbad so the isolated refresh has statistical power (WCE-2, n>=500/class).\n\nNew passages are matched fact pairs — a factually correct GOOD passage that must\nnever halt and a BAD passage corrupting exactly one grounded value, with\nexpected_fragment marking the single-token corrupted value where the\ncontradiction becomes detectable. streaming_halt_corpus_extended holds\nhand-authored pairs; streaming_halt_corpus_reference holds pairs built from\nauthoritative reference tables (periodic table, national capitals, dated\nhistorical events, anatomy / geometry / unit counts) so every grounded fact is\ncorrect by construction, not invented. Every bad fragment resolves to a valid\nexpected_halt_index and all pids are unique — pinned by a new invariant test.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"14e795d6ecfde2d2f360e627cec60f66792a4625","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/14e795d6ecfde2d2f360e627cec60f66792a4625"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKDgzYzRkMDU5Y2VkNWQ1NTVlZWY2ODc0ZTcxOTNhNWI4NWM5OTAyOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3","sha":"bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3"}],"sha":"83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/83c4d059ced5d555eef6874e7193a5b85c99029c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:00:31Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T16:00:31Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"bench(fever): committed FEVER dev result — 78.4% acc, 3-class large model\n\nFull held-out FEVER dev (n=18209 scored of 19998; empty premise/hypothesis\nskipped) with the working 3-class training/output/deberta-v3-large-hallucination\non a JarvisLabs A30 GPU. Accuracy 78.4%, macro-F1 0.773, all three classes\npredicted and balanced (entailment F1 0.863 / neutral 0.653 / contradiction\n0.803) — contradiction reachable and well-scored, unlike the NaN base-hallucination\ncheckpoint the new guard now rejects.\n\nThe artefact carries per-sample rows (label + predicted) so the accuracy is\nre-derivable, plus a provenance block (model, git_sha 11267e6f, python 3.10.20,\ngenerated_at). Allow-listed under benchmarks/results/ (KIMI3-fever, task #65).\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"cf18e40611b79ed8ce60b0f115aa209598b02c5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/cf18e40611b79ed8ce60b0f115aa209598b02c5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGJjZWFmYTMxY2U0YTYwNzMwZDAwNTgyODQ2NGI2Nzc0Mzk0NGMwZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679","sha":"11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679"}],"sha":"bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/bceafa31ce4a60730d005828464b67743944c0f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:22:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T15:22:54Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"fix(bench): decouple FEVER benchmark from the guardrail core import\n\nfever_eval imported director_ai.core.model_revisions at module scope purely to\nresolve the production default model name, but director_ai.core eagerly pulls in\nthe whole guardrail surface (async streaming, guard_control, safety_event, ...),\nwhich needs the full director_ai install and Python 3.11+ — so the benchmark\ncould not run in a minimal GPU environment (the JarvisLabs pytorch template\nships Python 3.10, and safety_event uses datetime.UTC).\n\nLazy-import DEFAULT_NLI_MODEL only when no model is named (the sole place it is\nused). With an explicit --model the import never fires, so the FEVER run needs\njust benchmarks._common (torch/transformers) + benchmarks._provenance + datasets\n+ scikit-learn. Behaviour is unchanged and the default-model test still passes.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"7e4307e6906a54ba6b0369e2b7b4398015ff0a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/7e4307e6906a54ba6b0369e2b7b4398015ff0a7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKDExMjY3ZTZmOGZkNzM4N2M2ODRiMWYxM2ViY2I0YzVkMzRkYTI2Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58","sha":"4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58"}],"sha":"11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/11267e6f8fd7387c684b1f13ebcb4c5d34da2679"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:02:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:02:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"fix(bench): FEVER uses working large NLI checkpoint + NaN-logit guard\n\nThe FEVER smoke test and usage docs pointed at\ntraining/output/deberta-v3-base-hallucination, which is a broken checkpoint: it\nemits NaN logits for every input, and argmax([nan, nan, nan]) collapses to\nclass 0 — so a full-dev run \"completed\" reporting a degenerate always-entailment\n35.1% instead of failing. (Confirmed empirically: a 5.5h CPU full-dev on that\ncheckpoint produced exactly that false number; neutral/contradiction never\npredicted.)\n\nPoint the test and docs at the healthy 3-class\ntraining/output/deberta-v3-large-hallucination (verified: all three classes\npredicted, contradiction reachable, ~80% on a 5-sample probe), and add an\nup-front NaN-probe guard in run_fever_benchmark so a broken checkpoint fails\nloudly in seconds rather than after a multi-hour degenerate run. The guard only\nruns with a real model; the label-space guard test (2-class -> ValueError,\nraised before the probe) is unaffected.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"d034511129a11f9fcaf1064fb0d1932398ab399f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/d034511129a11f9fcaf1064fb0d1932398ab399f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKDRjMDUwZDFlYjY5MDUxYjliMzNjNzYyMzg0YmJjYzkwMTU4YTRiNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440","sha":"1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440"}],"sha":"4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/4c050d1eb69051b9b33c762384bbcc90158a4b58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:23:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:23:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"fix(bench): skip sklearn-dependent FEVER artefact tests in core CI\n\nThe FEVER artefact and main-path tests build the artefact through\nNLIMetrics.to_dict(), which lazily imports sklearn — a benchmark-only dependency\nabsent from the core CI test extras — so they errored with\n`ModuleNotFoundError: No module named ''sklearn''` (CI red on 3b15829f, after the\ndatasets collection fix let them run).\n\nGuard those three on sklearn availability, matching how the rest of the\nbenchmark test surface skips in the core CI env. The label-space guard test\n(the methodology fix — refusing a 2-class model on 3-class FEVER) needs neither\nsklearn nor datasets and keeps running everywhere, so CI still verifies the\nsubstantive change; the artefact-shape and main-path tests run in the benchmark\nenv locally.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"3572c10cc147154df4a25e1aafec1748bb6533b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/3572c10cc147154df4a25e1aafec1748bb6533b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKDE4MTc5NDgxOTA5NjhjMDYzY2IxMTljNDExNDhmNjE3YjY0Zjg0NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d","sha":"3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d"}],"sha":"1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/1817948190968c063cb119c41148f617b64f8440"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:06:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T01:06:18Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"fix(bench): lazy-import datasets in fever_eval so tests/ collection is import-safe\n\nMoving the FEVER smoke tests into tests/test_fever_benchmark.py (a44ea5b5) made\nbenchmarks/fever_eval importable by `pytest tests/`, but its module-level\n`from datasets import load_dataset` is a benchmark-only dependency absent from\nthe core CI test extras — so collection failed with `ModuleNotFoundError: No\nmodule named ''datasets''` and interrupted the whole suite (KIMI3/#66 class; CI\nred on a44ea5b5, a local files-only pre-commit could not catch it because\ndatasets is installed locally).\n\nMove the datasets import into `_load_fever_dev()` so importing the module needs\nno benchmark deps: the artefact / guard / main unit tests now run in CI instead\nof erroring at collection, and only an actual benchmark run pulls datasets.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"91bc88c7b98a52ec5c5c82acb9094b2595376710","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/91bc88c7b98a52ec5c5c82acb9094b2595376710"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKDNiMTU4MjlmODllNmZiN2ZiNTQ1ZDg5OWNkMjIyZTcyNWQ2YzE0NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221","sha":"a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221"}],"sha":"3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/3b15829f89e6fb7fb545d899cd222e725d6c146d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:41:39Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:41:39Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"feat(bench): FEVER dev — committed artefact producer with 3-class guard\n\nKIMI3-fever: the FEVER dev benchmark only carried slow pytest smoke tests and\nno committed result, and its NLIPredictor default is the 2-class FactCG\nproduction model — which cannot produce a valid 3-class FEVER verdict (argmax\nover two logits never yields `contradiction`). Scoring FEVER that way would\nfabricate a plausible but meaningless accuracy.\n\nrun_fever_benchmark now fails loudly when the loaded model does not expose three\nlabels, naming the 3-class held-out model to use; the guard protects every\ncaller (run_all included). build_fever_artefact and main record the resolved\n`model` alongside the per-sample rows and the git provenance stamp, so the\ncommitted accuracy states which model produced it and can be re-derived offline\nwithout re-running inference.\n\nThe two model-backed smoke tests move to tests/test_fever_benchmark.py and now\nrun against the 3-class hallucination model, guarded on its presence, never the\n2-class default. New unit tests cover the artefact shape and model field, the\nnon-3-class guard, and both main output paths.\n\nCapability manifest regenerated for the new test file.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"9ff61aed9abd2709aeca18039b830fd385551cd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/9ff61aed9abd2709aeca18039b830fd385551cd9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGE0NGVhNWI1YjZjOGFhOTJmNjVjMjIyOWUxMTU3MWExNWE4NzgyMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca","sha":"dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca"}],"sha":"a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/a44ea5b5b6c8aa92f65c2229e11571a15a878221"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:21:44Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:21:44Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"feat(scoring): first-class abstained verdict + selective-prediction metrics\n\nKIMI3-abstain: when a ground-truth store is configured but retrieval finds no\nusable context, the factual signal falls back to the neutral 0.5 mid-score\nsilently — the caller cannot tell an ungrounded \"don''t know\" apart from a\ngenuine borderline verdict. CoherenceScore now carries an `abstained` flag,\nset in the verdict assembly from the same `evidence is None and\nh_factual == NEUTRAL` condition the no-KB calibration already keys on (gated on\na configured store, so logical-only mode without a store is not an abstention).\nNo scoring decision changes — the field is additive.\n\nThe new core.scoring.selective_prediction module turns a batch of\n`(CoherenceScore, is_hallucinated)` verdicts into the standard risk-coverage\npair: coverage (fraction judged, not abstained), selective accuracy (accuracy\non the covered subset), and an overall accuracy that counts abstentions as\nmisses so a guard cannot inflate its score by abstaining on the hard cases —\nthe honest reporting a conformal differentiator can build on.\n\nTests: 4 abstain-flag behaviour cases (no-store / grounded / ungroundable /\ndefault) + 6 selective-prediction cases. Capability manifests regenerated for\nthe new module, class, and test file.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"d094d2cca6ad3f5b5bc2999c1001beafaf89ba80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/d094d2cca6ad3f5b5bc2999c1001beafaf89ba80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/commits/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca","node_id":"C_kwDORQ8Eq9oAKGRjMzdjMTc4YTY1Y2RiZTYwZjUwODBiMDE0NzYyZTI5OGRmZTQyY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/director-ai/commit/81cfa4475599ae50acb7bcab7a80f2bb53bf1d55","sha":"81cfa4475599ae50acb7bcab7a80f2bb53bf1d55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/81cfa4475599ae50acb7bcab7a80f2bb53bf1d55"}],"sha":"dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/dc37c178a65cdbe60f5080b014762e298dfe42ca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/commits/81cfa4475599ae50acb7bcab7a80f2bb53bf1d55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-18T16:20:32Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-18T16:20:32Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Arcane Sapience"},"message":"fix(benchmarks): terminate saved artefacts with a trailing newline\n\nThe RAGTruth artefact committed in 83c8be52 lacked a trailing newline, so\nthe end-of-file-fixer pre-commit hook failed the ff36067f CI run — json.dumps\nemits no trailing newline and the artefact was committed via save_results\nwithout one (a full pre-commit --all-files would have caught it; the local\nfiles-only run did not include the artefact). save_results now appends the\nnewline so every generated artefact satisfies the hook, the committed RAGTruth\nartefact is fixed in place, and a test pins the trailing-newline contract.\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"e19e885417d975eac57cb4081633c07e3ada0573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/director-ai/git/trees/e19e885417d975eac57cb4081633c07e3ada0573"},"url":"https://api.github.com/rep