SAFE).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit db37b52c9869ce73af7688b45222eb2f348b783f)","tree":{"sha":"76d6edac3f117f321ca3c4d0ec10329d64fc8711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/76d6edac3f117f321ca3c4d0ec10329d64fc8711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/e6441db9dcb3891d1ed43514c2353687d7d705bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/e6441db9dcb3891d1ed43514c2353687d7d705bb","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGU2NDQxZGI5ZGNiMzg5MWQxZWQ0MzUxNGMyMzUzNjg3ZDdkNzA1YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2","sha":"dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2"}],"sha":"e6441db9dcb3891d1ed43514c2353687d7d705bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/e6441db9dcb3891d1ed43514c2353687d7d705bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:26:47Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T00:44:20Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): respetar dia de semana pedido (preferred_days) — no ofrecer otro dia\n\nCuando el paciente nombra uno o mas dias de semana (\"jueves o viernes\", \"solo martes\"), el modelo debe pasar preferred_days (que RESTRINGE a esos dias) en vez de solo poner interpreted_date. Corrige la descripcion del parametro (decia \"no bloquea\" cuando si restringe), los ejemplos que ensenaban a ignorar el dia (martes/jueves, no-viernes), y agrega regla: PROHIBIDO ofrecer un dia que el paciente no pidio.\n\nCaso ortodoncia (pruebas): pidio \"jueves o viernes\" y ofrecio martes/miercoles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 7487f9c5d5e95a5d5ccd4d2eb4587401c52155ab)","tree":{"sha":"9de4a2277e552b163f91b8ca9152d21c690c7b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/9de4a2277e552b163f91b8ca9152d21c690c7b1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/dd4d536283b6ff4b8d0c06936ce5462a93c96aa2","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGRkNGQ1MzYyODNiNmZmNGI4ZDBjMDY5MzZjZTU0NjJhOTNjOTZhYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/815c41621b0094d78530c93c309608fa63e00ec9","sha":"815c41621b0094d78530c93c309608fa63e00ec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/815c41621b0094d78530c93c309608fa63e00ec9"}],"sha":"dd4d5362