 vez de \"precio primero\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 76b072370f0d527c8a157047a29faa50172e2fff)","tree":{"sha":"55de25242f82fa643d8b6935937bfe296efbffc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/55de25242f82fa643d8b6935937bfe296efbffc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/b724824309d32a6d922cb5dfd84cda6971e5dfe1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/b724824309d32a6d922cb5dfd84cda6971e5dfe1","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGI3MjQ4MjQzMDlkMzJhNmQ5MjJjYjVkZmQ4NGNkYTY5NzFlNWRmZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/c6a94c35a6ad8e12b45f83beecfcd01aa1d01227","sha":"c6a94c35a6ad8e12b45f83beecfcd01aa1d01227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/c6a94c35a6ad8e12b45f83beecfcd01aa1d01227"}],"sha":"b724824309d32a6d922cb5dfd84cda6971e5dfe1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/b724824309d32a6d922cb5dfd84cda6971e5dfe1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/c6a94c35a6ad8e12b45f83beecfcd01aa1d01227/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T20:52:24Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:56:40Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agendamiento): turnos cercanos + reparar empujon de confirmacion + mensajes de error que re-ofrecen\n\nAuditoria de 12 agentes sobre casos reales (Graciela/Matias). 3 fixes SEGUROS (verificados):\n\n1. TURNOS LEJANOS (raiz, main.py:3443): en modo rango la rama ''espaciar'' ofrecia el dia\n   MAS CERCANO y el MAS LEJANO (Graciela: 15/07 y 29/07). prefer_nearest ahora es True salvo\n   para ''month'' explicito -> ''week''/preferred_days devuelven los 2 dias mas CERCANOS.\n   Solo cambia CUALES dias ya validados se muestran; no fabrica slots.\n\n2. LOOP DE CONFIRMACION (buffer_task.py:3827): el ''empujon'' que le dice al bot ''usa confirm_slot,\n   no check_availability'' era un f-string ROTO (3 fragmentos sin parentesis -> los 2 ultimos se\n   descartaban en silencio). Se envuelve en parentesis para que la instruccion realmente llegue.\n\n3. MENSAJE DE ERROR (main.py:108/110): UNAVAILABLE/CHAIRS_FULL decian ''no hay turnos para ese\n   tratamiento'' (confundia a Matias) -> ahora ''se ocupo recien; ofrecele horarios cercanos (NO\n   derivar)'' para que re-ofrezca en vez de derivar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit c61242b738be71511c23de97a424a9bc654af48e)","tree":{"sha":"5122c678a36a69261827a37a1cc8aa5e54c40e52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/5122c678a36a69261827a37a1cc8aa5e54c40e52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/c6a94c35a6ad8e12b45f83beecfcd01aa1d01227","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi