 ficha/contexto y si no figura, DERIVAR (no las tools de pago/turno)\n- PROHIBIDO pedir ''reenvia/remanda'' algo que dice haber dejado; solo recibir si ofrece uno NUEVO\n- motivo/mensaje de derivacion generalizados (placas/estudio/resultado/presupuesto/turno)\n\nCaso real Lucas: ''¿llegaron mis placas?'' -> el bot improviso ''reenviamelas'' en vez de derivar al equipo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6efa2871276781611ca5b14a014494417cdd7526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/6efa2871276781611ca5b14a014494417cdd7526"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/f12fef8c19a7fec2fcdc0eb10b3b15b55d2be9e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/f12fef8c19a7fec2fcdc0eb10b3b15b55d2be9e8","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGYxMmZlZjhjMTlhN2ZlYzJmY2RjMGViMTBiM2IxNWI1NWQyYmU5ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"h