t en buffer_task con autoreply/cooldown + filtro en lead_recovery\n- BLINDAJE: agent_error_tracking (068) — el bot nunca queda mudo: marca la conversacion + email a la clinica (best-effort) + bandera roja en Chats\n- RESENAS: review_engine (070) — boton en el chat + objetivo mensual + job de cierre + Telegram; envio por ResponseSender con verificacion de entrega + candado anti-repetir\n\nMigraciones 100% aditivas y reversibles (verificado: cadena lineal 066->070, un solo head, tenants.review_goal_monthly NOT NULL con server_default=''0'', models.py coincide).\nNO incluye el cache de prompt (main.py, pruebas-only) ni los dialogs del frontend.\nRevision: scope + migraciones OK (workflow); sanity inline de tenant-isolation/correlation_id/best-effort OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51828f39f04b2dcaba8fe807af4024944543d098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/51828f39f04b2dcaba8fe807af4024944543d098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/976c35ba83136caf52ef868bc6338625cadc5ee4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/own