received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/0f7929bf1bf742f160cc5324c916dcc0a8009e61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:43:30Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:54:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): anti-loop de cortesia — cierre unico + [SILENCIO] cuando el paciente solo agradece\n\n- Regla CIERRE DE CORTESIA: ante mensajes de pura cortesia sin pedido nuevo, cerrar UNA sola vez + end_conversation; si el cierre ya se hizo y el paciente vuelve a agradecer, responder [SILENCIO]\n- end_conversation: descripcion actualizada (combinable con [SILENCIO])\n- buffer_task: red de seguridad — [SILENCIO] solo => no se envia nada (usa el guard de respuesta vacia existente); embebido => se quita el token y se envia el resto\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aea1fec1732db5f6c8df814f1cd92faa531480fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/aea1fec1732db5f6c8df814f1cd92faa531480fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/0f7929bf1bf742f160cc5324c916dcc0a8009e61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://