s://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/4542761cfded6ffc65a2eff23280d91a8074ce54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:38:30Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T16:53:48Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): pregunta particular/OS obligatoria en flujos rapidos + coseguro sin montos\n\n- REGLA CERO, FAST TRACK, DETECCION IMPLICITA, F5 precio, flujo implantes y F2 urgencia: excepcion de cobertura — a paciente nuevo se le pregunta particular/obra social UNA vez antes de precio/turnos (combinable en el mismo mensaje; no aplica si la cobertura ya se conoce)\n- Coseguro: eliminados los 3 ejemplos con montos; regla de ORIGEN UNICO DE CIFRAS (solo copay_note o bloque OBRAS SOCIALES; nunca ejemplos/memorias); anti-repeticion sin cifras\n- REGLA DE COBERTURA: informar la condicion de coseguro configurada, no un monto\n- REGLA DE PRESENTACION: paciente con OS aceptada no recibe la plantilla de precio particular; precio por profesional (list_professionals) explicitado\n- email_service: dedup case-insensitive de destinatarios en email de derivacion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6382decdd9ce55a075e15240d8cc912704d65aaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/6382decdd9ce55a075e15240d8cc912704d65aaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/4542761cfded6ffc65a2eff23280d91a8074ce54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar