ithub.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/5eac5fe9a66db92d1371133940c7ad189131bbaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:00:23Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:00:51Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(recordatorio): excluir confirmaciones de PAGO + mensajes con adjunto del matcher\n\nRefuerzo del matcher confirmar-por-texto: \"confirmo el pago/la transferencia/\nla seña/el depósito\" (3 palabras) se marcaban por error como confirmacion de\nASISTENCIA (y salteaban la verificacion del comprobante). Se agregan terminos\nde pago a las exclusiones y se excluyen mensajes con adjunto (msg.media, posible\ncomprobante/foto) → los maneja el agente. Verificado: 27 casos, py_compile OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3512633258f89d29e855d73420fa85e6ae458c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/3512633258f89d29e855d73420fa85e6ae458c24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/5eac5fe9a66db92d1371133940c7ad189131bbaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"star