5:21Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T22:00:50Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"feat(recordatorio): confirmar asistencia por TEXTO marca la agenda + respeta override\n\nAntes solo el BOTON (o texto exacto) marcaba el turno como confirmado; una\nrespuesta por texto tipo \"Si confirmo..\" caia al LLM (friccion + no marcaba\nla agenda). Ahora el intercept determinista de chat_webhooks reconoce\nconfirmaciones por texto con matching tolerante: normaliza acentos/puntuacion,\nmensaje corto (<=3 palabras) con \"confirm\"/\"asisto\", guardia anti-negacion,\nexcluye preguntas (\"confirmas?\") -> marca el turno mas proximo como confirmed\n+ responde corto + salta el LLM.\n\nAdemas los 3 intercepts (confirmar/cancelar/reprogramar) ahora respetan el\noverride humano (not is_locked): con un humano al mando, no auto-actuan.\n\nVerificado: py_compile OK, 20+ casos de matching (confirma reales, excluye\n\"no confirmo\"/\"confirmo el pago\"/preguntas), revision adversarial.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51bb31f17e3b7b8019e2b105ef50c288d05f202d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/51bb31f17e3b7b8019e2b105ef50c288d05f202d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/dce5f3c1bee9b2e62c3f77f2b1cf6a1e8288f86b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY