de por texto (\"Si confirmo\") a un\nrecordatorio y el bot repetia dia/hora/sede + preguntaba \"¿todo bien con\nese horario?\" (friccion). Se agrega una regla en REGLAS DE USO DEL\nCONTEXTO: ante confirmacion de asistencia con PROXIMO TURNO en contexto,\nagradecer corto y calido, PROHIBIDO repetir horario/sede ni re-preguntar\nni iniciar agendamiento. Distingue confirmar-asistencia de elegir-slot.\nPortado del patron ya existente en el motor multi (specialists.py:941).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a32a9aec3b15bcf1ac3d1e082314cc3b80c12f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/4a32a9aec3b15bcf1ac3d1e082314cc3b80c12f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/fae99843869941f1ee29f6892ffdf8e42cbe3b06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/fae99843869941f1ee29f6892ffdf8e42cbe3b06","node