EXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T20:33:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): disciplina de mencion de turnos + FAST TRACK respeta la compuerta\n\n- (A) ULTIMO TURNO es contexto interno: el bot solo lo comenta si hay\n  SEGUIMIENTO POST-TRATAMIENTO activo (turno reciente); no menciona turnos\n  viejos ni ofrece agendar a partir de ellos (caso \"veo que tuviste turno\n  el 20/04\").\n- (B) PROXIMO TURNO: no re-recordar un turno recien confirmado en la misma\n  conversacion al responder otra pregunta (caso Hector).\n- (C) FAST TRACK ahora exige seleccion del paciente antes de pedir datos:\n  si check devuelve otras opciones, espera que elija (cierra el agujero de\n  la compuerta, caso Emanuel).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc475af9e75b75aa9120aac701adea550eee9262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/cc475af9e75b75aa9120aac701adea550eee9262"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/291a8363a336439868a6ecbeab451eaec79bec21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-o