e":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T20:33:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agendamiento): compuerta de seleccion + reprogramar confirma fecha real\n\n- prompt: no pedir datos ni agendar hasta que el paciente elija un turno\n  ofrecido, alineado con la DETECCION DE MATCH / Priority Gate existente.\n  Respeta el \"dale/ok/si\" seco de una sola opcion (no regresa el fix de\n  Susana) y solo repregunta con 2+ opciones ambiguas, una sola vez.\n- reschedule_appointment: la confirmacion usa la fecha real guardada en la\n  DB (new_dt) en vez del texto interpretado por el LLM, para que el bot no\n  se contradiga al reprogramar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8da2adecb784662b2d32a3db4808bce42b25b6ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/8da2adecb784662b2d32a3db4808bce42b25b6ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/6a63e7ed80c280c85725854b7637b880386890b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/6a63e7ed80c280c85725854b7637b880386890b8","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKDZhNjNlN2VkODBjMjgwYzg1NzI1ODU0Yjc2MzdiODgwMzg2ODkwYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/1bec8fa13c31038ccede9b53853d049cf7ffd2ff","sha":"1bec8fa13c31038ccede9b53853d049cf7ffd2ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/1bec8fa13c31038ccede9b53853d049cf7ffd2ff"}],"sha":"6a63e7ed80c280c85725854b7637b880386890b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/6a63e7ed80c280c85725854b7637b880386890b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/1bec8fa13c31038ccede9b53853d049cf7ffd2ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:18:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T19:20:44Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(turnos): el bot reconoce el turno de HOY (no lo trata como dia futuro)\n\nEl bot decia ''hoy no tenes turno'' aunque el paciente tuviera turno HOY, porque tenia\nque deducir solo si la fecha del turno era hoy (los LLM hacen mal la resta de fechas).\nAhora:\n- buffer_task calcula en CODIGO si el turno es hoy (dt.date()==now.date()) e inyecta\n  marcas explicitas: ''PROXIMO TURNO: ⚠️ TURNO DE HOY —'' y ''FECHA EXACTA: ... ES HOY, a las HH:MM''.\n- El prompt dice explicito ''HOY ES {current_time}'' y agrega reglas: reconocer el turno\n  de hoy (prohibido ''hoy no tenes turno'') + reprogramar mismo dia (ofrecer otros dias si\n  esa hora esta ocupada, derivar si no hay, sin loop).\n\nCaso Matias. Va a produccion. No toca check_availability/book_appointment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e5de95a2f48b1ca2aef636fc1760480ce2a2776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/0e5de95a2f48b1ca2aef636fc1760480ce2a2776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/1bec8fa13c31038ccede9b53853d049cf7ffd2ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_ad