"2026-07-01T12:18:22Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-01T12:18:22Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(turnos): reconocer ''semana siguiente'' como pedido de re-busqueda\n\n_detect_research_intent tenia ''la semana que viene'' y ''semana proxima'' pero NO\n''semana siguiente'' — cuando la paciente pedia ''la semana siguiente'' el bot no\ndisparaba una busqueda nueva y repetia los mismos turnos. Agrega los sinonimos:\n''semana siguiente'', ''siguiente semana'', ''la que sigue''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"112a69de06b717c9d9257cc6320b51beed44e70e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/112a69de06b717c9d9257cc6320b51beed44e70e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/b22327310ba62b06bf200a0198f7f1fe2d908931","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/b22327310ba62b06bf200a0198f7f1fe2d908931","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGIyMjMyNzMxMGJhNjJiMDZiZjIwMGEwMTk4ZjdmMWZlMmQ5MDg5MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/5e61d19bccbc4e34b63352b570e305c883c5523f","sha":"5e61d19bccbc4e34b63352b570e305c883c5523f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/5e61d19bccbc4e34b63352b570e305c883c5523f"}],"sha":"b22327310ba62b06bf200a0198f7f1fe2d908931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/b22327310ba62b06bf200a0198f7f1fe2d908931"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/5e61d19bccbc4e34b63352b570e305c883c5523f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T14:30:07Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T14:30:07Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): CRITICO — quitar {día} del f-string que dejaba mudo al bot\n\nEl f-string de build_system_prompt evaluaba {día} (variable inexistente) -> NameError\n-> process_buffer_task_fatal_error -> el bot NO respondia a ningun paciente (la respuesta\nfallback ademas quedaba suprimida). Introducido en a950358 (regla de dia de semana suelto).\npy_compile no lo cató porque los f-strings se evaluan en runtime, no al compilar. Reescrito\nsin llaves. La linea 11109 (\"Te esperamos el {día}\") NO se toca: esta en un string normal\n(no f-string), es texto literal para el LLM.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9face66185f81ce08152ba8c373eebd853b077d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/f9face66185f81ce08152ba8c373eebd853b077d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/5e61d19bccbc4e34b63352b570e305c883c5523f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/