0830233e10fe9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/a9503587979ef9dbeb5d289d0f14f1b4dc3ece1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:41:31Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T00:41:31Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): opciones verbatim + \"antes\" honesto + dia de semana suelto\n\n- Rafael: el LLM mal-transcribia las opciones (ej. mostro \"Martes 01/06\" cuando la tool\n  devuelve la opcion ya formateada y consistente, ej. \"Miercoles 01/07\"; 01/06 es lunes,\n  combinacion imposible para la tool). Refuerzo: copiar dia/fecha/hora EXACTO, prohibido\n  recalcular. + interpreted_date de un dia de semana suelto (\"miercoles\") = proximo dia real.\n- Denis: ante \"antes?\" sin nada mas cercano, no repetir las mismas opciones como si fueran\n  nuevas/mas tempranas; ser honesto (\"son las mas cercanas, antes esta reservado\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus