m","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"feat(nova): enviar_instrucciones_tratamiento — mandar las instrucciones cargadas en el tratamiento\n\nNueva tool de Nova (Telegram) para enviar a un paciente las instrucciones pre/post CARGADAS\nen un tratamiento (las mismas del envio automatico), NO una plantilla HSM. Reusa\n_format_pre/post_instructions (emite solo lo cargado, no inventa) + el envio multicanal\n_enviar_mensaje, y completa el nombre del paciente ({{nombre_paciente}} y [Nombre]).\nAditiva: no toca flujos existentes. Limite WhatsApp: requiere ventana de 24h; fuera de ella\nse usa enviar_plantilla (HSM aprobada).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cf9ba62f4e816b4ff27ba8312e0dc2485e9eb2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/8cf9ba62f4e816b4ff27ba8312e0dc2485e9eb2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/2c03f29125b8baf87ade27dad4d39a662d4d8fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/COD