:"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/df0263ca875962496799d6927cb7cf9c16488ba9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:15:19Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:15:19Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(AG-06): disponibilidad multi-dia usa la franja real por dia, sin inventar ni dias cerrados\n\nAnte un pedido multi-dia (\"del 1 al 8 con Laura, 30min\"), el agente inventaba un horario generico\n(10-17:30 igual para todos los dias) e incluia dias cerrados (sab/dom), en vez de usar la herramienta.\nSe agrega regla en el prompt de Nova: NUNCA inventar horarios; SIEMPRE usar verificar_disponibilidad\n(que ya lee la franja real por dia, fix a4b9d00/dc8c0ba); para un rango, llamarla por CADA dia y\nlistar SOLO esos slots reales, sin dias cerrados. Pasar professional_id y slot_minutes si se indican.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddb2128e6e20e33a8b2267e1448d293b937ec03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/ddb2128e6e20e33a8b2267e1448d293b937ec03c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/df0263ca875962496799d6927cb7cf9c16488ba9","verification":{"payload":null,"re