users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/cfebe9cf065b853df4398dcb3bfcf94d9b83d19f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:13:46Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:13:46Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(historia): Nova SIEMPRE guarda al dictar y devuelve el detalle real (no \"Listo\" pelado)\n\nAl dictar una evolucion por audio, el LLM a veces respondia \"Listo/hecho\" SIN llamar\ncrear_nota_clinica (se veia: sin el prefijo \"[Herramientas: ...]\") -> no guardaba nada.\nSe agrega una REGLA CRITICA en el prompt de Nova: ante un dictado clinico SIEMPRE llamar\ncrear_nota_clinica (o modificar_odontograma para odontograma), prohibido responder \"Listo\"\nsin llamar la tool, y confirmar con el DETALLE real (Motivo/Notas/Plan o el cambio de pieza).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d01134cb1c08b89ca557f405601a2983d0e4057a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/d01134cb1c08b89ca557f405601a2983d0e4057a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/cfebe9cf065b853df4398dcb3bfcf94d9b83d19f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"com