b.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/0c095840b3b93eecb83b8944ba32a344b0c6d97b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:10:24Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T15:10:24Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(AG-08): verificar la OS antes de afirmar cobertura + dar el coseguro real, sin pisar la charla\n\n(1) check_insurance_coverage: el ai_response_template (texto fijo) se usa SOLO para derivacion\nexterna (ISSN); para el resto devuelve el coseguro real (copay_notes) y el agente responde natural.\n(2) Prompt: regla BLOQUEANTE = prohibido afirmar/negar cobertura sin llamar la tool en el turno\n(arregla \"Integral Salud\" dada por cubierta sin verificar). F4 corregido: ahora dice claro \"no\ntrabajamos con esa OS -> particular + comprobante por si te corresponde reintegro\" (antes lo PROHIBIA).\nCoseguro: dice el monto ($30.000) si esta en los datos (nunca inventado), corta el loop de \"se abona\nel dia\", y mantiene la prohibicion de montos de TRATAMIENTO (la Dra evalua en la consulta).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3508b3a868f8f6bc2006ac75bcd8711e69df3460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/3508b3a868f8f6bc2006ac75bcd8711e69df3460"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicfor