pi.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/89fb918480d66ab05965355e6722bde93676a226/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:00:48Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:00:48Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(historia): la evolucion de texto se ve como texto, no como \"Odontograma actualizado\"\n\nLa vista de Historia y Evolucion enrutaba a la tarjeta de odontograma con SOLO mirar si el\nregistro tenia odontogram_data. Pero toda evolucion de texto HEREDA el ultimo odontograma (para\nno perder el grafico) -> se mostraba \"Odontograma actualizado\" y se ocultaba el texto dictado\n(Motivo/Notas/Plan), que igual estaba guardado. Ahora la tarjeta de odontograma se usa solo si el\nregistro nacio de un cambio de odontograma (record_type=''Odontograma'') o, legacy, si el diagnosis\ntrae lineas de cambio de pieza. Asi: dictar texto -> se ve el texto; dictar odontograma -> se ve\nel cambio. Sin migracion; los registros ya guardados muestran su texto al desplegar el front.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a91e96d15240e802eff9d8a430b9d33fa889aba","url":"https://api.github.com/