i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/43e458dd8fbd7bfa784278276546a7290e97f6b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:00:57Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T13:00:57Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(PLT-02/PLT-03): el odontograma del front ya no \"duplica\" caras (sacar el glow del diente)\n\nToothSVG aplicaba un drop-shadow (glow) al SVG del diente ENTERO segun el estado promovido a\nnivel diente (ej. ''caries''). Ese halo de 6px se desparramaba sobre la cara sana adyacente,\nhaciendola ver tintada -> parecia que se marcaban 2 caras cuando solo se cargo 1. El guardado y\nel coloreo cara-por-cara eran correctos (igual que la Ficha digital, que NO tiene glow). Se quita\nel glow (style filter de la linea 73 + el const fills + el import STATE_FILLS, ya sin uso) para\nalinear el front a la Ficha digital. Solo cambio visual (se pierde el halo estetico); no afecta\nbadges, contadores, marcar 2 caras a proposito, ni la Ficha digital.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5580bca6151bb66dcb307540264ac9e0d033125","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/b5580bca6151bb