ithub.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/a4b9d006f1ed61dcd13b1fc1d95f436f62af4d4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T22:35:09Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T22:35:09Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(AG-06): el agente de Telegram/Nova ofrece solo horarios de la franja real\n\nverificar_disponibilidad leia claves planas inexistentes day_config[\"start\"]/[\"end\"]\n(el schema real usa \"slots\":[{start,end}]), por lo que siempre caia a un horario fijo\n09:00-18:00 e ignoraba professionals.working_hours -> ofrecia turnos fuera de la agenda\nreal. Ahora resuelve la franja real (slots del profesional si se pidio, sino del tenant),\ngenera bloques que no cruzan el corte ni se pisan con turnos reservados, y nunca rellena:\nsi no hay opciones reales, lo dice. Nuevo parametro opcional slot_minutes (ej. 45). Funcion\nread-only y separada de check_availability de WhatsApp -> no afecta el agendamiento web.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87e07564d42b3ce3e1ff7c528cb9da3d38239bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/87e07564d42b3ce3e1ff7c