:"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/e2b6f5564b2823c8476e5f4410212a32bee5206d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:09:40Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T15:09:40Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(recordatorios): el botón \"reprogramar\" responde un solo mensaje (sin doble respuesta del AI)\n\nAl tocar \"Necesito reprogramar\", el handler enviaba el mensaje fijo y ADEMAS caia al\nagente AI, que respondia otra vez (2-3 mensajes redundantes, e incluia \"hoy\" mal en la\nfecha). Ahora, igual que los botones confirmar/cancelar, envia UN mensaje (con la fecha\nreal del turno, dia calculado de la fecha) y hace continue para saltear el AI. La\nreprogramacion real la maneja el AI cuando el paciente responde con el dia nuevo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f8dd7dc4414469f59cfcb4c9ecba27064fdf7ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/3f8dd7dc4414469f59cfcb4c9ecba27064fdf7ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/e2