rs/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/4ea4a0e26b674449b2f799a5df72064f8212e0e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:15:18Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T14:15:18Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(recordatorios): completar las 4 variables de la plantilla de confirmacion y mostrar la hora en zona Argentina\n\n_auto_detect_template_vars no reconocia el patron de la plantilla de confirmacion de turno\n(confirmar_turno_agendado_ok): devolvia 1 sola variable, asi que los parametros {{2}}{{3}}{{4}}\nde YCloud salian vacios -> 400 \"Required parameter is missing\" y el recordatorio no se enviaba.\nAhora el patron ''confirmar''/''agendado'' devuelve las 4 variables (nombre, dia, fecha, hora).\n\nresolve_variables formateaba appointment_datetime (timestamptz/UTC) sin convertir a hora\nArgentina, asi que la hora del recordatorio salia +3h (ej. 17:00 en vez de 14:00). Ahora\nconvierte a America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires antes de formatear dia/fecha/hora.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab4b26974f776c7c3fefe47f3d019e82fc17a64c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicfo