fi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/a03d22114520c3426dcf2462d3492479ef13099c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:55:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:55:25Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(recordatorios): el job diario corre a las 10:00 ART (no 10:00 UTC = 07:00 ART)\n\nschedule_daily_at usaba datetime.now() naive (= hora del servidor = UTC), asi que el job\nde recordatorios corria a las 10:00 UTC = 07:00 ART (demasiado temprano/invasivo). Ahora\nschedule_daily_at acepta un parametro tz (backward-compatible, default None = comportamiento\nactual) y check_appointment_reminders se registra con tz=Argentina -> corre 10:00 ART = 13:00\nUTC. La ventana del playbook (7-20) ya permite las 13 UTC, asi que el envio sale ~10:00 ART.\nVerificado el calculo de timezone (10:00 ART = 13:00 UTC, sin desfasaje de 3h).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65aafe7e60b62fc1d6b304f8da1656317af6d8b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicfor