i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/558c65d06f0546cd968cc6a0a1ac8e47caa805e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:17:29Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:17:29Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agendamiento): no contar fallos por slot ocupado/race como intento (F5/F6)\n\nbook_appointment incrementaba booking_attempts al entrar; un fallo por slot ocupado/\nrace/conflicto de agenda (UNAVAILABLE) contaba como intento del paciente -> al 3ro\nderivaba de mas. Ahora _track_book_error, cuando el code es UNAVAILABLE, des-cuenta el\nintento (nuevo decrement_booking_attempts con piso 0). Los conflictos/races (no son\nculpa del paciente) ya no acercan a la derivacion; los fallos atribuibles al paciente\n(DNI invalido, etc.) siguen contando. Complementa F8 (no se ofrecen ocupados) y F4\n(reset al cambiar de periodo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af9c8215838661d4065aeb9c847981693bf1c41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/