vents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/b49161534721249f99652824c0636f01f928cb2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:04:58Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T02:04:58Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agendamiento): aplicar min_appointment_date como piso duro en check_availability\n\nLa fecha minima del tenant (tenants.config->>''min_appointment_date'') solo se inyectaba\ncomo texto al prompt: si el LLM no la respetaba, check_availability aceptaba turnos\nantes de esa fecha. Ahora se carga config en el SELECT del tenant y se aplica un piso\nDURO en codigo, en el mismo punto donde se aplica el delay de la obra social (antes del\nauto-advance), de modo que dias-extra y salto de feriados lo hereden. Garantiza\nMAX(hoy+delay_OS, min_appointment_date) sin depender del LLM. Fail-open ante config invalida.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6063415b475511ca47037476d0182c9c8540efba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/606341