,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/5fea9eaee8cf3ae763d7a70ed85c895d5e23445f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T01:56:21Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T01:56:21Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(prompt): excepcion de cambio de fecha/periodo en el hint SLOT_LOCKED (alinea con F4)\n\nEl STATE_HINT de SLOT_LOCKED prohibia check_availability sin contemplar que el\npaciente pida otra fecha/mes/periodo. Si el detector _detect_period_change se pierde\nuna frase y el estado sigue SLOT_LOCKED, el LLM quedaba atrapado. Ahora el hint\nincluye una excepcion explicita: ante cambio de fecha/periodo o rechazo, re-buscar\ncon check_availability (no es loop ni motivo de derivacion). Red de seguridad de F4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"552eac3c999d81213da9681821683e3bff68f63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/552eac3c999d81213da9681821683e3bff68f63d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/5fea9eaee8cf