ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/463a3583edb36c7f8e4eea8f22f9d2714e312068/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T00:11:54Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T00:11:54Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(buffering): evitar mensajes que se pisan y bajar la latencia entre mensajes\n\n- buffer_task: abort-and-recompute antes de enviar. Si llegaron mensajes nuevos al\n  buffer de BufferManager mientras corria el LLM, se descarta la respuesta stale y\n  el loop recombina (el mensaje previo ya esta en el historial), evitando el\n  doble-reply / contestar el mensaje pasado. Fail-open; solo aplica al path de\n  BufferManager (esa key la puebla y limpia unicamente ese sistema).\n- buffer_manager: debounce WhatsApp 11s->8s, pausa entre burbujas 4s->2.5s,\n  polling del debounce 2s->1s. Baja la latencia percibida entre mensajes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"803ba50a5bffbeeb3207b8b1d99a59fc7744c5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/803ba50a5bffbeeb3207b8b1d99a59fc7744c5e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/463a3583edb36c7f8