mments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/cd68677ac067a657b9cc79d3978ea37f4face864/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:27:22Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T22:28:30Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agendamiento): reservar con el profesional que ofrecio check_availability\n\nbook_appointment elegia el profesional prioritario por defecto, ignorando la derivacion que uso check_availability (por eso un blanqueamiento de paciente nuevo se ofrecia con Elizabeth pero se reservaba con Laura). Ahora lee el professional_id que check_availability dejo en lead_context y reserva con ese, salvo que el agente haya especificado otro profesional.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e049df9d797ebffe71f0f441c079587a3988ce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/1e049df9d797ebffe71f0f441c079587a3988ce0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/cd68677ac067a657b9cc79d3978ea37f4face864","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/