ibular) resolve to vestibular (last-write-wins semantics).","tree":{"sha":"73e9feaaa42a94649f0a5ceee7d8dd3ed5181d37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/73e9feaaa42a94649f0a5ceee7d8dd3ed5181d37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/f852e95c1c2f69b8f8da034eb7e9a16f570a3b16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177816802?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa","id":177816802,"login":"adriangmrraa","node_id":"U_kgDOCplE4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adriangmrraa","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/f852e95c1c2f69b8f8da034eb7e9a16f570a3b16","node_id":"C_kwDORRQYztoAKGY4NTJlOTVjMWMyZjY5YjhmOGRhMDM0ZWI3ZTlhMTZmNTcwYTNiMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commit/59716d09dce1ad22d4a16689a6eb3c6069f331f9","sha":"59716d09dce1ad22d4a16689a6eb3c6069f331f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/59716d09dce1ad22d4a16689a6eb3c6069f331f9"}],"sha":"f852e95c1c2f69b8f8da034eb7e9a16f570a3b16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/f852e95c1c2f69b8f8da034eb7e9a16f570a3b16"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/59716d09dce1ad22d4a16689a6eb3c6069f331f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:18:28Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:18:28Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(seguimiento): graduar la respuesta al seguimiento post-atencion\n\nEl contexto del seguimiento post-atencion ahora ramifica segun el grado: dolor fuerte / complicacion (sutura suelta, inflamacion, sangrado, fiebre) o turno de hace varios dias/semanas -> derivar al equipo (triage_urgency avisa a Telegram si es grave); molestia leve y turno reciente -> tranquilizar, no derivar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e320bcba843ae26519d84dcea5fe67d40979067e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/e320bcba843ae26519d84dcea5fe67d4097