_url":"https://github.com/CODEXY-ofi","id":281972831,"login":"CODEXY-ofi","node_id":"U_kgDOEM6QXw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/eb13f937b91b1204bbf9344c3585a5b44943b0f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:10:10Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:10:10Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(recordatorios): arreglar envio automatico 24h y reprogramaciones\n\n- job diario: calcular la ventana de \"manana\" en hora local (tz-aware) en vez de naive/UTC; antes dejaba fuera los turnos de la tarde/noche\n- dedup: no bloquear por ejecuciones \"completed\" (los turnos reprogramados quedaban sin recordatorio nuevo)\n- reset de reminder_sent al reprogramar desde Agenda admin y desde Nova (igual que el agente IA), para que el turno reprogramado vuelva a recibir recordatorio\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9aaa9f9efcc3725e17286aebc6683e1dec569321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/9aaa9f9efcc3725e17286aebc6683e1dec569321"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/eb13f937b91b1204bbf9344c3585a5b44943b0f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODE