ers/CODEXY-ofi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/commits/fda583c8fa663e52f0718a18a1a6c558c2cdb62f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T13:49:06Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T13:49:06Z","email":"contact@codexyoficial.com","name":"CODEXY-ofi"},"message":"fix(agent): reducir derivaciones prematuras (turnos perdidos)\n\n- catch-all: derivar SOLO ante fallo repetido de tool (2+) o pedido explicito de humano; la ambiguedad se repregunta, no deriva\n- situacion no cubierta por F1-F10: contener + ofrecer evaluacion antes de derivar; no derivar por errores de tool ni por falta de disponibilidad\n- retry de disponibilidad: exigir minimo 3 rangos (week/month/mes siguiente) antes de rendirse; prohibido derivar por disponibilidad con menos de 3 rangos\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e87571f0b9ce30ab69404743cedebd30ba78e8f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/trees/e87571f0b9ce30ab69404743cedebd30ba78e8f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/adriangmrraa/clinicforge/git/commits/fda583c8fa663e52f0718a18a1a6c558c2cdb62f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/281972831?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CODEXY-ofi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u