pacta filas y\ntipografía para que estorbe menos. Sube la saturación de las fotos de\nfondo y limita el oscurecido al costado izquierdo, dejando el resto de\nla imagen a la vista.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eedeec876b13726f1b0e8a451dec5500ca8eaa8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jurten/turnero-websocket/git/trees/eedeec876b13726f1b0e8a451dec5500ca8eaa8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jurten/turnero-websocket/git/commits/737aad834f033151fb4b3672013e2167771770af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jurten/turnero-websocket/commit/737aad834f033151fb4b3672013e2167771770af","node_id":"C_kwDORRyjvNoAKDczN2FhZDgzNGYwMzMxNTFmYjRiMzY3MjAxM2UyMTY3NzcxNzcwYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jurten/turnero-websocket/commit/17aac5d8ae7599cdf893832092940382b9a70dfa","sha":"17aac5d8ae7599cdf893832092940382b9a70dfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jurten/turnero-websocket/commits/17aac5d8ae7599cdf893832092940382b9a70dfa"}],"sha":"737aad834f033151fb4b3672013e2167771770af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jurten/turnero-websocket/commits/737aad834f033151fb4b3672013e2167771770af"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jurten/turnero-websocket/commits/17aac5d8ae7599cdf893832092940382b9a70dfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:16:48Z","email":"justina@Justinas-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Justina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T17:16:48Z","email":"justina@Justinas-MacBook-Air.local","name":"Justina"},"message":"Agrega carrusel de fotos de fondo en el display\n\nPermite subir/borrar fotos desde el panel (arrastrar y soltar,\no selección múltiple) y las muestra en rotación como fondo del\ndisplay para promocionar oportunidades inmobiliarias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b32208f1328c45ad121b56b